message: "If you use this framework, please cite it as below."
type: article
title: "Knowledge Continuity Engineering: A Framework for Persistent Knowledge Across Human and AI Generations"
authors:
  - family-names: Roșca
    given-names: Mihai
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-1422-6209"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher, BRIDGRAI Ecosystem"
